    "classLevel.accessibleName" : {
      "comment" : "Accessible name (screen reader) and tooltip of the three-bar level icon after a class name in a list (F067): {level} is the level word of classLevel.allLevels … classLevel.advanced in the viewer's language, e.g. 'Niveau: Gevorderd'. Never shown for Geen or Alle niveaus in a list.",
